0..80 Comment "//! A signature stated over a finite shape. The member `boundary Square { … }`"
81..161 Comment "//! names the carrier the signature\'s cells are stated over, one name per point,"
162..239 Comment "//! and each `face` member a face a cell may be fixed on, the subshape of the"
240..258 Comment "//! names it holds"
259..338 Comment "//! [Nuyts-2026-facett_generalization_intensional_type_systems_glue]: the shape"
339..418 Comment "//! parameter `ft` and its subshapes. The points run in name order. The block\'s"
419..497 Comment "//! value codes the shape at the head of its sort chain, so a program reads it"
498..517 Comment "//! back by `case`."
518..521 Comment "//!"
522..599 Comment "//! - cites: [Nuyts-2026-facett_generalization_intensional_type_systems_glue]"
600..603 Comment "//!"
604..840 Comment "//! [Nuyts-2026-facett_generalization_intensional_type_systems_glue]: https://types2026.cse.chalmers.se/files/book-of-abstracts.pdf \"Schönlank, Nuyts and Devriese, Towards FaceTT: A Generalization of Intensional Type Systems with Glue\""
842..917 Comment "/// Cells over a square of four corners, top left to bottom right: its left"
918..989 Comment "/// and right sides, its top and bottom, one corner and the empty face."
